  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "熱心に何を読んでるんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000610020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "ファッション雑誌よ\r\n見て。この帽子、可愛くない？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100061/1802001000610020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000610030,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "合わせてる服もいい感じだし\r\nこれは欲しくなっちゃうわね～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100061/1802001000610030"
  },
  {
    "select": "帽子が好きなのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000611"
  },
  {
    "select": "ファッションが\r\n好きなのか？",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000612"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "流行に敏感なんだな",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000613"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000610040,
    "label": "1802001000611",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "アクセントになるでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100061/1802001000610040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000610050,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "服に合わせたコーディネイトを考えるのも\r\n楽しくて、つい夢中になっちゃうわ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100061/1802001000610050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000610060,
    "label": "1802001000612",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そうね、単純に好きなのもあるけど\r\nやっぱり自分をよりよく見せたいじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100061/1802001000610060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000610070,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "自分らしい魅力をアピールできるように、\r\nスタイリングには手を抜けないわ",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100061/1802001000610070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000610080,
    "label": "1802001000613",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "それは芸能人だもの\r\n最低限の知識として必要よ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100061/1802001000610080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000610090,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "でも私らしさは大事にしてるんだから\r\nそこのところ、間違えないでもらいたいわね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
